{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "meta": {
    "name": "SocialGest Design System Tokens",
    "prefix": "sg",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "source": "Figma + src/styles/_tokens.scss (SocialGest section, prefix $sg-)",
    "lastUpdated": "2026-08-03",
    "notes": "Tokens puros (colores, tipografía, espaciado, radios, sombras, breakpoints) de SocialGest. El color primario (azul) y las escalas semánticas (success/warning/error/grey/neutral) son idénticas a Quantico y AdvocatesPro. El color secundario NARANJA (#f47a37) es distintivo de SocialGest."
  },

